<title>USA: 360 Communications rumored to issue debt.</title>
<headline>360 Communications rumored to issue debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>360 Communications Co is rumored to be tapping the corporate bond primary market this week with a $200 million debt offering, syndicate sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of a Ba1/BBB-minus rated 10-year issue.  Salomon Brothers Inc is expected to be lead underwriter on the offering, sources added.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the deal.</p>
<p>(( --Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
